            "review_title": "Review at Tori Soba Mutahiro",
            "review_text": "Ohori H\nJapan692 contributions\n0\nDelicious chicken soba shop\nJan 2026 • Couples\nInside the store is clean and almost counter seats\nThe atmosphere of a Japanese ramen restaurant was exactly the same.\nOrder special chicken soba ✨ Gentle golden soup is often tangled with noodles. The chicken taste is delicious. The char siu was soft and the taste balls were soaked with flavor up to the yolk ☺️ The char siu bowl was like cooked rice.\nI was also interested in crab soba. You can use your card.\nRead more\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten January 4, 2026",
