            "review_title": "Review at Tori Soba Mutahiro",
            "review_text": "Leonhkny\nHong Kong, China29703 contributions\n0\nTsukemen in Ho Chi Minh City\nDec 2022\nHo Chi Minh City's Japantown is a lively place after sunset. With so many pubs, clubs and restaurants concentrated in a couple tiny alleys, it is somehow unsurprising to find ramen joints. What makes this small place special is the food quality. Tori Soba Mutahiro is the only choice for chicken tsukemen and it has nailed it. The dipping sauce is flavorful but not excessively salty. Chicken chashu is tender with the aroma of peppercorn. Presentation is loyally Japanese and price pretty reasonable. Excellent post-drink option.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 3, 2022",
