            "review_title": "Review at Tori Soba Mutahiro",
            "review_text": "YSKing\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam269 contributions\n0\n深夜まで営業してる鳥そば屋\nFeb 2019 • Friends\n一番人気は塩鳥そば。\nあっさりしつつもコクのあるスープはファンが多いです。\n日本では行列のできる人気店のようです。\n期間限定、数量限定のラーメンも不定期に発売されますが、いつも評判になります。\n24時過ぎまで営業しているので飲んだ後に頼りになります。\n\n写真は塩鳥そばと限定の煮干そば\n\nThe most popular is salty chicken noodles.\n There is a lot of fans with a soup that has a rich but mild taste.\n In Japan it seems to be a popular shop that can be lined up.\n Limited-time and limited-number noodles will also be released irregularly, but will always have a reputation.\n Since it is open until 24 o'clock, it is reliable after drinking.\nRead more\nWritten May 9, 2019",
